  "notes": [
    "Each row in xp_by_source is one XP source: the base amount, the Facilities multiplier, the Coaches XP bonus (a fraction, 0.0848 = +8.48%) and the final XP.",
    "final_xp = base_xp x facility_multiplier x (1 + coach_bonus). For every duplicate_card source the multiplier is 1.0 and the bonus is 0, so final_xp = base_xp.",
    "The match_win row is a control that proves the upgrades are active in the same scenario.",
    "Only Film Room is varied (as in the existing C# boundary test). Weight Room and Rehab Center stay at level 0.",
    "Source names follow Progression: duplicate_card_<rarity> and match_win.",
    "Expected values are calculated from the written rules, not copied from running the game."
  ],
